{"jobs":[{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/bungie/jobs/5921280004","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":true,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":true,"retention_period":730,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":5123412004,"location":{"name":"United States, Remote"},"metadata":[{"id":4367803004,"name":"Cost Center","value":"GAMES6US27-USU1950653 Bungie Design Marathon","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4167524004,"name":"Career Page - Office Location","value":"United States, Bellevue, WA","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4167525004,"name":"Career Page - Department","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":9377282004,"name":"Career Page - Sub Department","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":20089613004,"name":"Career Page - Studio Project","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4395289004,"name":"Worker Type","value":"Employee","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4404049004,"name":"Country","value":"United States of America","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":9262269004,"name":"Job Family","value":"Production Artist","value_type":"short_text"},{"id":9262270004,"name":"Job Family Group","value":"Graphic Arts","value_type":"short_text"},{"id":21724118004,"name":"Bungie Geo Pay","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"}],"id":5921280004,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:48:35-04:00","requisition_id":"R-123738","title":"Marathon UI/UX Director","company_name":"Bungie","first_published":"2026-04-23T14:15:22-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Bungie is seeking a UI/UX Director to drive and own the vision and quality execution of Marathon’s player interface. As a UI/UX Director you will be responsible for defining problem spaces and executional strategy based on product needs and goals. You will collaborate with other discipline directors to align on goals, constraints, and execution. You will also be accountable for unblocking, empowering, and managing the UI/UX discipline and ensuring the quality of their craft.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;In the context of Marathon, you are a member of a director level leadership group that directs efforts across multiple Marathon teams. You will be accountable to the Assistant Game Director while continuing to drive consistent and holistic user experience across project wide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Own, driving, and communicating the UI/UX vision for Marathon based on creative and production priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Own Marathon UI/UX quality, design craft excellence, and consistency while holding UI/UX teams accountable to achieving vision and goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Prioritizing the UI/UX backlog, breaking down UI/UX problems for UI/UX Leads to own. and communicating status with other leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Build alignment in the Director leadership group of UI/UX goals, constraints, and executions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work with Executive Producer to make sure teams are staffed appropriately for size and shape of goals, including strategy for using external development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Develop and champion best practices of UI/UX process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Collaborating on creative problem solving for product wide problems spaces beyond UI/UX.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Works with Executive Producer and Engineering Director on goals and needs of UI Technical Design, Visual Design, UI/UX tools and workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;REQUIRED SKILLS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience as a UI/UX Director developing and implementing UI/UX vision for large-scale, multiplatform, live-service competitive FPS games.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ability to creatively align and collaborate with other director level discipline leaders to help define and break down problem spaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Leading UI/UX teams in developing philosophy, process, capabilities, and execution. · Deep Experience with philosophy, process, design, documentation, and workflows of UI/UX systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Leading UI/UX teams to break down ambiguous problems spaces to clear goals, strategies, and tactics with testable hypothesis and tracking metrics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Defining what successful UI/UX collaboration and integration looks like with other disciplines including User Research.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Managing UI/UX discipline including defining UI/UX roles, performance expectations, leading the hiring process, and building a highly functioning discipline. · Extensive demonstrated ability to work independently, driving tasks to completion with efficiency and reliability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proactive in making design decisions and solving problems with a focus on the broader impact to the overall project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Social intelligence, great interpersonal skills, and empathy for creative teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At SIE, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the base pay range may vary in line with our hybrid working policy and individual base pay will be determined based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;is eligible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; for SIE’s top-tier benefits package that includes medical, dental, vision, matching 401(k), paid time off, wellness program and coveted employee discounts for Sony products. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role also may be eligible for a bonus package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.playstation.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to learn more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$222,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$258,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4078476004,"name":"Bungie","child_ids":[4103606004],"parent_id":4078475004}],"offices":[{"id":4046556004,"name":"USA-WA-Bellevue-106th Ave","location":"Bellevue, Washington, United States","child_ids":[4076523004],"parent_id":4094639004}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/bungie/jobs/6181868004","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":true,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":true,"retention_period":730,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":5210956004,"location":{"name":"United States, Remote"},"metadata":[{"id":4367803004,"name":"Cost Center","value":"GAMES6US27-USB1950676 Marketing Marathon","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4167524004,"name":"Career Page - Office Location","value":"United States, Remote","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4167525004,"name":"Career Page - Department","value":"Bungie","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":9377282004,"name":"Career Page - Sub Department","value":"Publishing and Marketing","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":20089613004,"name":"Career Page - Studio Project","value":"Other","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4395289004,"name":"Worker Type","value":"Contingent Worker","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4404049004,"name":"Country","value":"United States of America","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":9262269004,"name":"Job Family","value":"Program/Projects","value_type":"short_text"},{"id":9262270004,"name":"Job Family Group","value":"Marketing","value_type":"short_text"},{"id":21724118004,"name":"Bungie Geo Pay","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"}],"id":6181868004,"updated_at":"2026-09-04T19:18:56-04:00","requisition_id":"R-125265","title":"Principal Marketing Manager, Marathon (Contract)","company_name":"Bungie","first_published":"2026-09-04T19:18:05-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;The Bungie Publishing team is seeking a Principal Marketing Manager (Contract) to lead integrated global go-to-market strategy and planning for Marathon. Reporting to the Director, Marathon Franchise Marketing, this role will translate franchise strategy, product roadmaps, audience insights, and business objectives into cohesive marketing plans that acquire new players, reengage existing owners, and deepen the commitment of Marathon’s active community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as a senior cross-functional leader across Brand, Product Marketing, Growth, Community, Communications, Creative, Analytics, Finance, regional teams, and Development. The ideal candidate combines strategic judgment with operational leadership: someone who can create clarity from complexity, align senior stakeholders around difficult decisions, and continually improve our plans through player insight and performance data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Own the development of integrated global GTM strategies for major Marathon releases, seasons, and franchise moments, ensuring plans support franchise priorities, player needs, and business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Translate franchise strategy, product roadmaps, audience priorities, and business objectives into clear marketing strategies, launch architectures, milestones, and investment recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Develop audience-led plans spanning acquisition, reactivation, retention, engagement, and long-term player value across paid, owned, earned, community, platform, and regional channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Establish and lead the cross-functional GTM operating rhythm, including planning milestones, readiness reviews, decision points, dependency management, risk tracking, and post-launch learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Align senior stakeholders and executional partners around priorities, roles, tradeoffs, and success measures, ensuring critical information and decisions are communicated clearly and consistently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Identify GTM risks and opportunities early, develop actionable recommendations, and drive timely resolution across Publishing, Development, and regional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Partner with Brand and Creative teams to translate Marathon’s positioning and creative strategy into consistent, audience-relevant campaigns and player experiences across channels and markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Partner with regional marketing teams to adapt global strategies for North America, EMEA, APAC, and LATAM while maintaining a cohesive franchise approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Partner with Analytics, Insights, Product Management, and Finance to establish audience targets, performance benchmarks, measurement plans, and budget-efficiency goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Define, monitor, and report against franchise and campaign KPIs, including awareness, consideration, acquisition, conversion, reactivation, retention, engagement, revenue, and ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Lead marketing performance reviews and translate player, market, and campaign insights into optimization plans that inform future campaigns, product beats, and investment decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Guide global paid media strategy, budget allocation, and agency partnerships as part of the broader integrated GTM plan, optimizing investment across channels, audiences, and regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Partner with Product Management and Development to unlock value from first-party platform relationships and identify opportunities that strengthen reach, engagement, and commercial performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Provide clear direction to agencies, vendors, and executional partners through strong briefs, aligned scopes, disciplined budget management, and timely feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; 7+ Years experience leading integrated marketing, product marketing, or GTM strategy within gaming, technology, entertainment, or another complex consumer business; experience operating at a global scale is strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Demonstrated success leading complex, cross-functional launches or live-service marketing programs with meaningful audience and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Deep familiarity with game franchises and online player communities, ideally within first-person shooters, extraction shooters, or live-service games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Strong understanding of the full marketing mix, including brand, product marketing, community, communications, creative, partnerships, lifecycle marketing, organic channels, paid media, and player acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Ability to translate product strategy, audience insight, and business goals into clear GTM choices, integrated plans, and investment recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Proven ability to influence senior leaders, align teams without direct authority, and resolve competing priorities across complex organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Strong analytical and commercial judgment, with experience defining success measures and using performance data, research, and player insight to improve strategy and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Exceptional written, verbal, and presentation communication skills, with the ability to make complex topics clear, compelling, and actionable for executive and cross-functional audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Demonstrated ability to create clarity across multiple complex workstreams, establish priorities and decision points, and drive stakeholders toward timely resolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Sound judgment and adaptability when navigating changing product plans, emerging player sentiment, competitive disruption, or other high-pressure business challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Nice-to-Have Skills&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Deep familiarity with Marathon, its evolving player community, and the broader competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Expertise marketing live-service games across launch, seasonal, reactivation, and long-term lifecycle moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Experience developing global strategies that can be effectively adapted for regional markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Experience managing major media investments, external agencies, and first-party platform partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At SIE, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the base pay range may vary in line with our hybrid working policy and individual base pay will be determined based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;is eligible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; for SIE’s top-tier benefits package that includes medical, dental, vision, matching 401(k), paid time off, wellness program and coveted employee discounts for Sony products. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role also may be eligible for a bonus package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.playstation.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to learn more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$156,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$185,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4078476004,"name":"Bungie","child_ids":[4103606004],"parent_id":4078475004}],"offices":[{"id":4023537004,"name":"USA-WA-Telecommute","location":"Washington, United States","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4094639004}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/bungie/jobs/6139094004","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":true,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":true,"retention_period":730,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":5197893004,"location":{"name":"United States, Remote"},"metadata":[{"id":4367803004,"name":"Cost Center","value":"GAMES6US27-USB1950677 Marketing Shared","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4167524004,"name":"Career Page - Office Location","value":"United States, Bellevue, WA","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4167525004,"name":"Career Page - Department","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":9377282004,"name":"Career Page - Sub Department","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":20089613004,"name":"Career Page - Studio Project","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4395289004,"name":"Worker Type","value":"Contingent Worker","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4404049004,"name":"Country","value":"United States of America","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":9262269004,"name":"Job Family","value":"Producing (PD)","value_type":"short_text"},{"id":9262270004,"name":"Job Family Group","value":"Product Development","value_type":"short_text"},{"id":21724118004,"name":"Bungie Geo Pay","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"}],"id":6139094004,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:48:35-04:00","requisition_id":"R-124957","title":"Senior Producer, Multimedia (Contract)","company_name":"Bungie","first_published":"2026-08-07T16:34:38-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;Bungie is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Producer, Multimedia &lt;/strong&gt;to lead creative media production from intake to delivery. The Senior Producer will oversee projects across multiple mediums, including gameplay capture, art &amp;amp; design, video and livestream production. This role will drive alignment between Creative Leads, Brand &amp;amp; Marketing teams, external vendors, and finance stakeholders, ensuring projects are strategically scoped and delivered to AAA studio standards. The ideal candidate combines game industry expertise with a strong track record of facilitating cross-functional collaboration and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Principal Operations Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the production of multimedia content throughout the project pipeline, ensuring timely delivery across platforms, including short-form gameplay videos, GIFs, screen shots, composites, live action video, livestreams, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as production partner for studio stakeholders, creative leads, game development leads, and external vendors, building relationships and driving alignment across project goals, scope, timelines, approvals, and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain streamlined, proactive cross-team communications with partner teams, including legal, PR, finance, localization and game development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate project scope, hours, and costs with a critical eye toward efficiency, value, and stakeholder goals, including diligence on bids and external estimates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project meetings, timelines and documentation, including production schedules, budgets, key milestones, and stakeholder reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and refine production workflows, tools, and documentation to improve clarity and efficiency, driving toward a maximized sustainable output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain assessment of creative team capacity and capabilities, scaling talent as needed to foster sustainability while meeting business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience producing digital media, ideally in the gaming or entertainment industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record delivering multiple concurrent projects on agile timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated rigor in project tracking throughout asset lifespan, adhering to communication norms, transparent processes, and industry best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, including experience with budgeting, scoping, tracking, and resource planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with video production pipelines, both gameplay and live action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional interpersonal and communication skills with ability to speak in creative and operational contexts across all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trusted partnerships and navigate complex stakeholder environments with diplomacy and confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be a creative problem solver who is highly adaptable and solutions-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of Microsoft Outlook, Excel, Word, PowerPoint, Miro, and project management software such as Asana/Jira&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on expertise producing live-action and/or livestream events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Adobe Creative Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At SIE, working with our partners, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the individual base pay range may vary based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role is eligible for benefit offerings that include medical, dental, and vision. Click &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dzconnex.com/summary-of-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below, this is an hourly rate.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$63.50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$75 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4078476004,"name":"Bungie","child_ids":[4103606004],"parent_id":4078475004}],"offices":[{"id":4046556004,"name":"USA-WA-Bellevue-106th Ave","location":"Bellevue, Washington, United States","child_ids":[4076523004],"parent_id":4094639004}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null}],"meta":{"total":3}}

{"jobs":[{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/krafton/jobs/8524447002","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":6404691002,"location":{"name":"Seoul"},"metadata":[{"id":4031285002,"name":"Employment Type","value":"Professional Contractor","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":32641866002,"name":"Sector","value":"Chairman Projects","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13514260002,"name":"Corp./Studios","value":"KRAFTON","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13514261002,"name":"Job Category - Art","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13514262002,"name":"Job Category - Business & Service","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13514263002,"name":"Job Category - Data","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13514264002,"name":"Job Category - Development Management","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13601005002,"name":"Job Category - Game Design","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13601006002,"name":"Job Category - Tech","value":"Platform Programming","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13601007002,"name":"Job Category - TA","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13601008002,"name":"Job Category - QA","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13601009002,"name":"Job Category - Sound","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13601010002,"name":"Job Category - UX/UI","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13601011002,"name":"Job Category - IT Infra","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":13601012002,"name":"Job Category - Management Supporting","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8524447002,"updated_at":"2026-08-28T06:25:39-04:00","requisition_id":null,"title":"[AI Frontier Div.] AI Native Full Stack Engineer (7년 이상)","company_name":"KRAFTON","first_published":"2026-05-06T22:11:18-04:00","language":"ko","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;우리는 게이머의 로망을 실현하기 위해, 누구도 가지 않는 길을 갑니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;예상을 뛰어넘는 과감한 상상력과 기술로, 전 세계 팬들이 잊지 못할 세상을 만들기 위해 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;담대하게 도전하고 개척합니다.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We pioneer the path to players&#39; dreams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;With bold imagination and breakthrough technology, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;we create unforgettable worlds for fans across the globe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우리 팀(프로젝트)을 소개합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;AI Frontier 본부는 크래프톤의 핵심 AI 기술 역량을 실질적인 사업 성과로 연결하는 실행 중심 조직입니다. &lt;br&gt;In-game AI, Production AI, LLM AI 등 6개 Squad가 각각의 사업을 빠르게 실험하고 스케일업합니다.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;우리가 찾는 AI Native Engineer는 AI를 단순한 보조 도구가 아닌 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;핵심 개발 파트너&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;로 활용하면서, 동시에 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;대규모 트래픽 환경에서 서비스를 안정적으로 설계·운영한 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;을 갖춘 시니어 엔지니어입니다.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;AI 기술이 빠르게 변화하는 만큼, 새로운 모델과 도구를 누구보다 빨리 습득하고 프로덕션에 적용하는 것도 중요하지만, 그 기술을 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;안정적이고 확장 가능한 서비스로 만들어 고객에게 전달하는 것&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;이 궁극적인 목표입니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우리 팀과 함께할 미션을 소개합니다.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Squad(사업 실행 단위) 소속으로 PO와 함께 AI 기반 제품의 기획·개발·배포·운영 전 과정을 책임&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;1&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;AI 모델을 활용한 서비스 기능 설계 및 구현 (프롬프트 설계, API 통합, RAG 파이프라인, MCP 연동, 에이전트 오케스트레이션 등)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;2&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;프론트엔드와 백엔드를 아우르는 End-to-End 서비스 개발 및 운영&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;3&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;모델 추론(Inference) 파이프라인 구축, 최적화 및 안정적 운영을 위한 모니터링 시스템 개발&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;4&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;대규모 트래픽 환경에서의 서비스 아키텍처 설계 및 성능 최적화&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;5&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;서비스 안정성을 위한 CI/CD 파이프라인, 데이터 파이프라인 설계 및 운영&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;이런 경험을 가진 분과 함께 성장하고 싶습니다! (필수요건)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;서비스 개발 역량 (핵심)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;7년 이상의 소프트웨어 개발 경력&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt; 또는 그에 준하는 실력을 보유한 분&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Backend(Node.js/Python/Kotlin/Go 중 하나 이상) 중심의 서비스 개발 경험. 서비스의 전체 흐름을 이해할 수 있는 분&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;기획부터 테스트, 배포, 서빙까지 하나의 흐름으로 책임질 수 있는 End-to-End 서비스 개발 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;RDBMS 및 NoSQL 데이터베이스에 대한 이해와 활용 능력&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;서비스 안정성과 확장성을 고려한 설계 및 운영 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;서비스 운영 역량&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;실 서비스 운영 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt; — 대규모 트래픽 환경에서 서비스를 배포하고 안정적으로 운영한 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;모니터링 및 장애 대응&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt; — 모니터링 체계 구축부터 장애 발생 시 원인 분석·해결까지의 경험 (Datadog, Grafana 등)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;CI/CD 및 인프라 운영&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt; — 자동화된 배포 파이프라인 설계 및 운영 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;AI Native 개발 역량&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, Google Antigravity, Cursor 등&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;코딩 에이전트를 일상적 개발 도구로 활용&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;하며, 에이전트의 강점과 한계를 이해하고 있는 분&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;Context &amp;amp; Harness Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt; 경험 — CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, Rules 등 프로젝트 컨텍스트 설계를 통해 에이전트의 출력 품질을 체계적으로 관리하고, 도구 권한 설계·안전 제약 조건·검증 루프 등 에이전트의 런타임 제어 체계를 구축해본 분&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;플러그인, 스킬 시스템, MCP(Model Context Protocol) 등&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;에이전트 도구 생태계에 대한 이해&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt; 및 커스텀 도구/플러그인 개발 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;멀티 에이전트 시스템 설계 또는 에이전트 오케스트레이션&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt; 경험이 있으면 더욱 좋습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot;&gt;문제 해결 및 협업&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;문제 정의부터 솔루션 구현까지 독립적으로 수행 가능한 역량&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;기술적 의사결정을 문서화하고 팀에 공유하는 습관&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;비개발 직군과의 원활한 협업이 가능한 커뮤니케이션 역량&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;빠르게 변화하는 AI 기술 트렌드에 대한 높은 학습 의지와 적응력&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;해외 출장에 결격 사유가 없는 분&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;이런 경험들이 있다면 저희가 찾는 그 분입니다! (우대요건)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;클라우드 환경(AWS, GCP, Azure) 활용 및 프로덕션 수준의 아키텍처 설계 경험. Kubernetes(k8s), Docker 등 컨테이너 기반 배포 및 IaC(Infrastructure as Code) 경험 포함&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
