&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL-jo6xxhd52BavMVKclBJw&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;크래프톤 공식 유튜브 채널&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCms8Ge7H1ZGgw6nV94fUhUQ&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;배틀그라운드 공식 유튜브 채널&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
