&lt;p id=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;KRAFTON is a global video game organization headquartered in Seoul, South Korea, known for its commitment to “Keep the craftsmanship on.” We develop and publish world-class titles such as PUBG: Battlegrounds, Subnautica, inZOI, and others through our internationally recognized studios, including PUBG Studios, Unknown Worlds, and Tango Gameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;1&quot; class=&quot;paragraph--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; data-paragraph=&quot;true&quot; data-type=&quot;p&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text--da25a3913a1dd210&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As part of our expanding global operations, the Legal Team is seeking an experienced Commercial Counsel to support a wide range of commercial transactions, IP management, and broader legal operations across Krafton and its affiliates worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
