&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4274&quot;&gt;You will own well-scoped projects from design through production, with senior engineers alongside you, on both the current delivery path and the next generation of the architecture. Technologies include Go, AWS, Terraform, and Datadog, but exact tool match matters less than strong fundamentals and a real appetite for learning how large systems behave.&lt;/p&gt;
