&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4649&quot;&gt;Build, ship, and operate features and services in Flag Delivery&#39;s streaming and polling infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4756&quot;&gt;Own well-scoped projects end to end: design, implementation, rollout, and the operational tail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4855&quot;&gt;Investigate and fix production issues, participating in the team&#39;s on-call rotation with support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4956&quot;&gt;Write maintainable, well-tested code and take part in code and design reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5038&quot;&gt;Improve the observability and reliability of the code you own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5104&quot;&gt;Collaborate with SDK Engineering, Data Platform, and product-engineering teams on work that crosses boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5219&quot;&gt;Grow your depth in distributed systems and production operations with mentorship from senior engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
