&lt;p&gt;If you thrive in a fast-paced, consultative sales environment, have experience selling to small and mid-sized companies, and are eager to make an impact, we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outbound Pipeline Development.&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively prospect into and qualify ICP target accounts across the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Value Alignment.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery sessions to understand customer goals and challenges. Articulate LaunchDarkly’s core use cases and demonstrate the value of our usage-based pricing model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Presentation &amp;amp; Demos.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Solutions Engineers to customise and deliver impactful demos. Lead proofs of concept that showcase measurable value to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Relationship Management.&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong relationships with prospects and existing customers. Identify and develop new opportunities within existing accounts. Educate and guide customers through the adoption of LaunchDarkly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Enablement.&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with internal teams, including customer success, support, and product to ensure customer needs are met. Deliver customer insights and feedback to influence product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Reporting.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate data in Salesforce and sales tools. Provide consistent, reliable forecasting on a weekly and monthly basis. Meet or exceed quarterly revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About You:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Sales Success. &lt;/strong&gt;Strong track record of exceeding quota in a SaaS sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Selling Skills.&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in running discovery, managing multiple stakeholders, and selling value-based solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Starter &amp;amp; Organized.&lt;/strong&gt; Highly motivated, disciplined, and able to manage multiple priorities independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Centric Mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; Passionate about understanding customer challenges and delivering solutions that drive outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative &amp;amp; Curious. &lt;/strong&gt;Team-oriented, intellectually curious, and eager to grow your career at LaunchDarkly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
