&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of success in a closing role within SaaS sales. (Or, have a proven track record of hitting or exceeding quota)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to corporate or SMB customers.&lt;/li&gt;
