&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4913&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2b02bfec4725&quot;&gt;LaunchDarkly’s Experimentation team is building one of the company’s most strategic product areas: a platform that helps leading engineering organizations move beyond intuition and make product decisions with real statistical confidence. Sitting at the intersection of large-scale systems, data science, and user experience, the team is creating a best-in-class experimentation product that lets customers set up, manage, and analyze experiments with ease while still earning the trust of even the most rigorous data teams. From warehouse-native analysis to experimentation workflows built on top of LaunchDarkly’s massive feature management scale, this team is tackling ambitious technical problems with visible customer impact and a clear opportunity to define the future of modern software experimentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5723&quot; data-local-id=&quot;787ee67937df&quot;&gt;As the Engineering Manager, you&#39;ll bring a balance of people management and technical leadership as you drive the development of the multiple services that power this product and foster a high-performing, collaborative engineering culture.&lt;/p&gt;
