&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3469&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c017993f3c63&quot;&gt;Software powers the world, and LaunchDarkly empowers teams to deliver and control it safely. As a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; on the Flag Delivery team, you will own the critical-path systems that stream feature-flag configuration to every connected SDK globally, in near real time. These systems run at high scale and have to stay reliable, low-latency, and correct; when they fail, customers lose control of their features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3893&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15dfabb57ac9&quot;&gt;This is added headcount on a growing team. You will work on the next generation of the flag-delivery architecture, streaming rollouts, and reliability and scale hardening. Our stack is Go, AWS, Terraform, and Datadog, but exact tool match matters less than deep backend expertise and a track record of owning production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
