&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4243&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bc87f11756e5&quot;&gt;Design, build, and operate the distributed systems that deliver feature-flag configuration to LaunchDarkly SDKs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4359&quot; data-local-id=&quot;adf5de55b879&quot;&gt;Own and improve the reliability, latency, and scalability of our streaming and polling infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4465&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88f07c5cedc3&quot;&gt;Debug and resolve complex production issues, sharing the team’s on-call rotation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4550&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3f7e596ac8a8&quot;&gt;Partner with SDK, Core Product, and Data Platform teams on how flags reach customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4639&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9db373068963&quot;&gt;Write maintainable, well-tested code and engage in code reviews, design reviews, and production-readiness discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
