&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4761&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8fab859f2398&quot;&gt;Drive architectural decisions, trading off performance, cost, and operability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4843&quot; data-local-id=&quot;72ec9bd72122&quot;&gt;Raise the bar on observability, deployment safety, and operational process for Flag Delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
