&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5589&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20a39cbd91b0&quot;&gt;Own LaunchDarkly’s authentication surface end to end — single sign-on, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SCIM&lt;/span&gt; provisioning, login and session flows, multi-factor authentication, and API key and token authentication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5774&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a11a17329e29&quot;&gt;Build the enterprise identity capabilities our largest customers require: additional identity-provider integrations, support for multiple IdPs per account, and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;MFA&lt;/span&gt; enforcement by default.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5965&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bed55769f73b&quot;&gt;Make the stack operable: SLOs, monitoring for certificate expiry and provisioning failures, actionable alerting, runbooks, and a sustainable on-call.&lt;/p&gt;
