&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6118&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed884dfe8242&quot;&gt;Partner with Product Security on threat modeling, audit logging, and compliance requirements including SOC 2 and FedRAMP.&lt;/p&gt;
