&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6243&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bf221098ab6d&quot;&gt;Set the technical direction for identity at LaunchDarkly, and raise the bar for the engineers around you through design review and mentorship.&lt;/p&gt;
