&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6607&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d2c9e6235263&quot;&gt;A track record on systems where correctness and availability are non-negotiable, and the habits that come with it: backward-compatible change, staged rollouts, and safe cutovers.&lt;/p&gt;
