&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7974&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea78298a8ace&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers and raise the team&#39;s bar for statistical rigor and system design.&lt;/p&gt;
