&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, LaunchDarkly recruiters will only contact you from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://launchdarkly.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;launchdarkly.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses or via LinkedIn from &quot;Verified Recruiter&quot; accounts. Be cautious of emails from other domains.&amp;nbsp; Legitimate LaunchDarkly recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before making a job offer. LaunchDarkly will never make a job offer without conducting a formal interview process. Our interview process does not involve asking detailed questions by email. If you are ever unsure about a communication that you receive, don&#39;t click any links—visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://launchdarkly.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Careers | LaunchDarkly&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; directly for confirmed job openings and links to apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please notify us of any fraudulent representation by sending an email to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@launchdarkly.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers@launchdarkly.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;","departments":[{"id":4082358003,"name":"Release Engineering","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4024614003}],"offices":[{"id":4012901003,"name":"US - Oakland, CA (HQ)","location":"Oakland, California, United States","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/7886222003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/launchdarkly/jobs/7866054003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"education":"education_optional","internal_job_id":5823796003,"location":{"name":"Remote - US"},"metadata":[{"id":4281358003,"name":"Other Employment Types","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4544902003,"name":"Departments","value":"Product","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":7866054003,"updated_at":"2026-08-14T18:47:46-04:00","requisition_id":"3140","title":"Staff Product Manager - Data Products and Agent Interface","company_name":"LaunchDarkly","first_published":"2026-08-13T17:48:52-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;ebc7991f25b2&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;LaunchDarkly is seeking a creative and experienced Product Manager to lead our end-to-end data products, from SDK data ingest through our data platform to the customer-facing observability, metrics, and experimentation experiences built on top of it. You will own the vision and strategy for this entire pipeline as a coherent product, ensuring the data customers send us is trustworthy, timely, and transformed into experiences that help them ship better software. The ideal candidate has a deep understanding of data infrastructure, observability/analytics, and how customers consume and work with software delivery data. As we evolve our data product experience to primarily focus on agent interface with data, this person will also lead our agent interface work (CLI, MCP, Skills, etc.) for our data products and overall for the LaunchDarkly platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0f5c8f99-f515-4ca7-a99f-b7c04833ee4e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;bulletList&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;fe7bd547-cfb6-4714-8865-8f8c376784cd&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;438d0fecc330&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Define and lead the product vision, strategy, and roadmap for LaunchDarkly&#39;s end-to-end data products, spanning SDK event ingestion, our data platform, and customer-facing data products, ensuring alignment with company goals and customer requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;404fefb9-4f8b-4852-8395-e6795cdf50fa&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;296f5e97b661&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Own the strategy for AI-powered analysis of our data and the agent experience of our data products: how AI surfaces insights, anomalies, and recommendations from software delivery data, and how our data is modeled, exposed, and made consumable so that AI agents are first-class consumers alongside humans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;0597081e-9bee-4aac-9606-fc8a00b7db8a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;388c9b2a0f8e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Treat the data pipeline as a single product: drive coherence across ingestion, processing, storage, and consumption so that every downstream experience (analytics, experimentation, insights, integrations) is built on a reliable, well-modeled foundation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;c53eb79b-7586-4bee-86c0-0da1566e2f8d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
