&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ec50b220-2703-4f78-bd37-7c4b78a14df2&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;326fffc5af95&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mentor and uplevel other product managers, and raise the bar for data-informed product practice across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
