&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Communications Lead &lt;/strong&gt;to own the next phase of our strategy and growth for how we elevate Webflow’s story and how we bring it to market – be it about our company, thought leadership, product, customers, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This highly strategic role will be responsible for shaping and delivering the company’s narrative, managing external communications, overseeing media relations, crisis communications, and brand reputation as we scale globally. In this role, you will partner with our executives, product marketing, social, and brand marketing teams to develop communication strategies that support key brand moments and product launches, driving share of voice across key media partners and publications, and amplifying Webflow’s narrative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Remote-first (United States)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exempt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The cash compensation for this role is tailored to align with the cost of labor in different geographic markets. We&#39;ve structured the base pay ranges for this role into zones for our geographic markets, and the specific base pay within the range will be determined by the candidate’s geographic location, job-related experience, knowledge, qualifications, and skills.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;United States&amp;nbsp; (all figures cited below are in USD and pertain to workers in the United States)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
