&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Communications Lead, you’ll …&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our executives, customers, investors, and other leaders at Webflow to develop key narratives we want to bring to market, secure buy-in from leadership on comms strategy, and activate it across all earned and owned media channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and execute all aspects of Webflow&#39;s external communications strategy, including developing and implementing media plans, coordinating press opportunities, and collaborating closely with internal comms, social, and employer brand to ensure consistent messaging across every channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own executive voice strategy: partner directly with the C-suite on press opportunities, speeches, op-eds, and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead external press relations by managing PR agencies to deliver strategic, measurable results, while partnering with internal comms, social, and employer brand teams to ensure Webflow’s story is amplified with clarity and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain lasting relationships with key business and tech media to ensure they understand Webflow’s unique position as the agentic web marketing platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise the executive team on communications strategy and thought leadership opportunities, preparing them to maximize opportunities including media interviews and public engagements (e.g., keynotes, podcasts, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with marketing, product, and other teams to amplify and extend the reach of our biggest campaigns and company milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
