&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the technology industry and the ability to translate complex concepts (e.g. AI, product innovation, market dynamics) into clear, compelling narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success managing PR agencies to deliver measurable results in media coverage, share of voice, and reputation impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll thrive as a Communications Lead if you:&lt;/p&gt;
