&lt;li&gt;This posting is for an existing vacancy&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting to the Director, Demand Generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Demand Generation Associate, Field Programs&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the demand gen execution layer for field plays and event activations. Every Webflow event and field play has a set of DG mechanics that determine whether the investment produces a pipeline. You&#39;ll own those mechanics end-to-end including outreach sequencing, list management, event follow-up coordination within 48 hours of event close, and post-campaign reporting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full lifecycle ownership of Webflow&#39;s third-party sponsorship portfolio — vendor evaluation, contract coordination, budget ownership, campaign integration, and post-campaign reporting for programs like Exit Five, MarTech, Morning Brew and others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the gifting program end-to-end — campaign trigger setup, execution, inventory management, ROI tracking, and program reporting; treat gifting as a campaign tool tied to specific program moments, not a transactional function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the demand gen point of contact for sponsorship and gifting programs — ensuring Sales, XDR, and Field Marketing have a clear, current picture of what is running, what has landed, and what the results show&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and iterate on AI-assisted workflows that support this role&#39;s core programs — sponsorship research and evaluation, gifting campaign briefs and copy, post-event reporting, and stakeholder updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy AI agents in production workflows with humans in the review loop — designing systems where agents make routing, offer, and content decisions where appropriate, and knowing when a decision requires a human&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the role over time from executing against defined programs to proposing and shaping the sponsorship and field activation strategy — owning a point of view on where Webflow should show up and what outcomes those investments should drive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel up to 15-20% for company and team offsites&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requirements:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 years of experience in demand generation, revenue marketing, growth marketing or a similar function at a B2B SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of coordinating cross-functional programs across Sales, SDR/XDR, and marketing with named examples of how you kept stakeholders informed and investments on track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working experience with AI tools in production workflows - has personally built or iterated on AI-assisted sequences, briefs, or reports (not just used ChatGPT as a search tool)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with marketing automation and CRM systems (e.g., Marketo, HubSpot, Salesforce) for campaign setup, tracking, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll thrive as a &lt;strong&gt;Demand Generation Associate, Field Programs&lt;/strong&gt; if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are operationally disciplined - you get things done on time, on brief, and with clean documentation; nothing slips through your queue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think beyond the brief - you don&#39;t just execute the program calendar, you notice patterns in what&#39;s working and start forming opinions about where Webflow should show up next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and proactively - Sales, XDR, and Field Marketing teams learn to trust you because they always know what&#39;s running, what&#39;s landed, and what the results show without having to chase you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat every investment as measurable - you don&#39;t ship a sponsorship, gift send, or event without a defined success metric attached to it and a reporting plan already in place&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring judgment about when to use AI and when not to - you build AI workflows that save time on research, drafting, and reporting, and you know when a human decision is required before a campaign goes live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have vendor and program management instincts - you can evaluate a sponsorship offer against alternatives, negotiate scope, and hold vendors accountable for delivering what was contracted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay curious and open to growth - demonstrating a proactive embrace of AI, and actively building and applying fluency in emerging technologies to elevate how we work, drive faster outcomes, and expand collective impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
