&lt;li&gt;Build, restructure, and maintain full-funnel LinkedIn campaigns across upper, mid, and lower funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy account-based and contact-level audience lists supplied by the growth team, including customer and current-pipeline exclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage tiered Sponsored Messages, Document Ads, and single-image programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a weekly optimization cadence: bids, budgets, audience refinement, creative rotation, CPM and efficiency management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run Meta mid-funnel retargeting and account-based programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute in-platform experiments — audience, format, bid strategy, funnel structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA expansion&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage EMEA full-funnel LinkedIn campaigns (UKI, DACH, France) from approved regional strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain separate regional retargeting pools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep EMEA segmented from core market at all times, in both build structure and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand awareness&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own brand campaign builds and monthly optimization cycles across LinkedIn and Meta&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure brand work on reach, frequency, and brand lift signals — not direct conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner and account-based programs&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute partner co-marketing and account-based campaigns on paid social from approved briefs and audience lists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle audience activation, campaign QA, and launch checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement hygiene&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own UTM construction and QA for every campaign you launch, following documented team conventions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report performance against MQL and Sales Accepted Opportunity pull-through using Salesforce and Tableau — platform metrics are diagnostic only&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag anomalies with a diagnosis attached, not just a metric&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
