&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Meta for B2B retargeting and account-based targeting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience being held to CRM-sourced pipeline metrics, not platform conversions — comfortable in Salesforce and a BI tool like Tableau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigor about tracking: UTM discipline, naming conventions, clean campaign hierarchies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running multi-region programs where regions are measured separately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-direction. You&#39;ll get clear priorities and be trusted to execute without daily check-ins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
