&lt;li&gt;Client Logos aligned with our ICP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have prior experience of SaaS Enterprise partnerships such as Optimizely &amp;amp; Contentful&lt;/li&gt;
