&lt;li&gt;Build long term collaborations and champion partner account adoption, expansion, and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Partner Sourced opportunities resulting in a pipeline for our Sales Led team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
