&lt;li&gt;Great communicator&amp;nbsp;with the ability to explain complex concepts in a simple way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll thrive as a &lt;strong&gt;Sales Development Representative&lt;/strong&gt; if you:&lt;/p&gt;
