&lt;li&gt;Are a high energy individual with a strong desire to achieve top results with a dependable, positive “can-do&quot; attitude over the phone/video calls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a team player with a proven ability to work cross functionally and deliver results&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are excited to find success in ambiguity, and to contribute back to the larger organization on best practices and scaling success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay curious and open to growth — demonstrating a proactive embrace of AI, and actively building and applying fluency in emerging technologies to elevate how we work, drive faster outcomes, and expand collective impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
