&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Place durable bets as the AI landscape shifts. &lt;/strong&gt;Models, protocols, and techniques are rapidly evolving; you&#39;ll stay close to customers, adapt fast, and differentiate between new standards and fads.&lt;/li&gt;
