&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in international environments, preferably across multiple entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong English communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Excel and other MS Office tools&lt;/li&gt;
