&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1o8myef&quot; data-start=&quot;215&quot; data-end=&quot;321&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience recording and maintaining accruals, prepaid expenses, and reclassification entries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1o8myef&quot; data-start=&quot;215&quot; data-end=&quot;321&quot;&gt;Experience performing flux analysis, including identifying, investigating, and explaining significant period-over-period variances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team-oriented mindset with a focus on shared goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with ERP systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Oracle ERP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a shared service center or centralized accounting function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a technology or similarly dynamic, multi-entity environment&lt;/li&gt;
