 is looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Associate Product Manage&lt;/strong&gt;r to join our MONOPOLY GO! Game team in Barcelona hub on a hybrid basis (3X week in office).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MONOPOLY GO! is a global phenomenon and the biggest mobile game launch in history, captivating millions of players worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team responsible for keeping MONOPOLY GO!&#39;s live minigames accurate, reliable, and ready for players. You will help coordinate recurring events from planning and implementation through playtesting, release readiness, and post-event learning, while building the product judgment to take on broader responsibilities over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the operational health of live-minigame cycles, maintaining transparency across milestones, ownership, and potential project blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate rigorous playtesting sessions; documenting findings, managing defect triage, and ensuring all critical regressions are resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit final configurations against technical specifications to identify discrepancies and finalize pending decisions prior to deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional synchronization between Engineering, Design, Art, to ensure seamless event execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain comprehensive documentation of strategic choices and project velocity to foster team alignment and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support launch readiness by preempting risks and refining operational workflows through rigorous post-release analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leverage AI tools and automation to streamline evidence comparison and documentation while ensuring the integrity of project outputs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Authentic enthusiasm for the mobile gaming landscape and a desire to understand the mechanics behind maintaining long-term game integrity and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven background in operations, product, design, or analytics, developed through professional roles, academic projects, or significant practical application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous precision and execution, capable of auditing features from initial documentation to final release to ensure absolute consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity and a systems-oriented mindset; you seek to master new platforms and address core issues rather than surface-level fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive communication skills to highlight discrepancies, define ownership, and advocate for resolution when launch readiness is threatened.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate delivery and the capacity to synchronize efforts across diverse functional groups and shifting project timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional administrative skills, with the ability to navigate multiple concurrent events through various lifecycle phases without losing focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical aptitude and a history of leveraging automation and AI to enhance workflow efficiency and the reliability of project outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous involvement with mobile gaming, live-service products, or similarly dynamic digital environments where agility is paramount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in navigating data and digital platforms to diagnose complex challenges and substantiate strategic decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated history of implementing AI solutions and automation to optimize operational workflows and elevate team-wide productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
