"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a highly motivated &lt;strong&gt;Director of Performance Marketing&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Performance Marketing team in &lt;strong&gt;Shanghai &lt;/strong&gt;to support a &lt;strong&gt;new&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;unannounced mobile ARPG based on a major IP&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
