ly","first_published":"2026-08-13T06:52:46-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Systems Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Star Trek Fleet Command team in the UK on a remote basis.&lt;/p&gt;
