&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Creative, Data, and Marketing teams to improve full-funnel performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and scale strategic acquisition partnerships and new growth opportunities globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute creative insights and testing strategies to improve ad performance and acquisition efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on market trends, platform changes, and best practices in mobile performance marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in User Acquisition, performance marketing, or media buying, preferably in mobile gaming or mobile apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of scaling growth through paid acquisition channels and identifying high-impact opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of UA KPIs including CPI, ROAS, retention, conversion funnels, and LTV optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with platforms such as Google Ads, Meta, and AppLovin; DSP, ad networks, and rewarded advertising experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to make data-driven decisions in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, stakeholder management, and ownership mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel skills, AI tools, and data visualization platforms (e.g., Looker) are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with Product, Creative, Data, and Marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree in Economics, Mathematics, Marketing, Finance, Business, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for mobile advertising, experimentation, and continuous optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
