":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior 3D Artist&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;MONOPOLY GO!&lt;/strong&gt; team in Barcelona on a hybrid basis.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and strive to inspire play every day—whether through our collaborative work environment or our connection with the global communities who enjoy our games. We are a diverse team of passionate creators developing, publishing, and innovating within the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world every day.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;MONOPOLY GO! is a global phenomenon and the biggest mobile game launch in history, captivating millions of players worldwide.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver 3D assets that capture Monopoly GO!&#39;s established art style on time and at a high bar, working closely with Art Leads and 2D concept artists to stay aligned with the season&#39;s direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, refine, and share repeatable AI-assisted workflows for recurring production needs, evaluating emerging tools against real production challenges and incorporating them where they meaningfully improve the work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest and help implement improvements to the 3D pipeline, and maintain a solid understanding of exporting and optimizing assets from DCC tools to Unity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give clear feedback to both internal and outsourced 3D artists, and mentor junior artists informally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the point of contact for 3D questions on your assigned features, working cross-discipline with narrative, design, and product to keep things moving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience as a 3D artist working in games, with 2+ years in a senior-level capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and applying repeatable AI-assisted workflows in production, with the judgment to evaluate where they improve quality, consistency, or efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record delivering high-quality 3D work on schedule, collaborating across Design, Engineering, and outsourcing partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in 3D modeling and texturing tools (Maya, Blender, 3ds Max, ZBrush, Substance), with a solid understanding of modeling, texturing, shading, lighting, rendering, and exporting assets to Unity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive attitude and the ability to give and receive objective feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating the brand guidelines and approval pipeline of at least one externally-licensed IP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting outsourcing partners&#39; quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for playing and making games&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
