&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a strong pipeline of A/B tests and live optimizations, defining hypotheses, KPIs, and success criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead performance readouts and turn learnings into broader strategies and best practices across the Mini Games portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously optimize gameplay, balancing, rewards, pacing, and other live levers to improve player experience and performance&lt;/li&gt;
