&lt;li&gt;Act as a go-to product expert for your areas of ownership and proactively communicate performance, insights, risks, and recommendations to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help raise the performance, experimentation, and analytical rigor of the wider team&lt;/li&gt;
