&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of using data, experimentation, and product judgment to improve measurable product outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the ability to independently turn complex data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining hypotheses, KPIs, A/B tests, and performance readouts&lt;/li&gt;
