eadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a smart, technically strong, and process-adaptive &lt;strong&gt;Senior QA Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;to join our Royal Lounge Casino team in Bangalore on a hybrid basis&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 30M+ downloads, Grand Casino is home to slots, bingo, cards, and more! Team members are distributed across the globe with hubs in Bengaluru, Tel Aviv, Barcelona, among others&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write, maintain, and execute test cases for studio games across mobile and web platforms, covering a broad range of devices, operating systems, and browsers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform functional and non-functional testing of mobile applications, including network traffic, API responses, and log analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Scrum teams, Producers, Developers, and QA Leads/Managers to ensure releases meet high quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate proactively with Developers and business stakeholders during defect triage to reduce defect ageing and drive timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct root cause analysis for defects and provide corrective and preventive action plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively in an Agile environment to support timely and high-quality product delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify quality trade-offs, project risks, and appropriate mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a detailed understanding of studio games, including gameplay flows, player journeys, edge cases, and game-specific scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain QA documentation, including test cases, test plans, test reports, training material, and process documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior QA team members and support their technical and domain growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the QA Lead to continuously improve QA processes, test coverage, and release quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support team coordination and delivery in the absence of the QA Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–7 years of experience in software testing, preferably across mobile, web, or gaming products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong familiarity with mobile and web platforms from a QA perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of client-server architecture, APIs, application data flow, and network debugging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in test design, test execution, defect reporting, regression testing, and risk-based testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong exploratory testing skills, with the ability to select the right test approach based on feature complexity and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using QA tools such as Jira, TestRail, Charles Proxy, Fiddler, browser developer tools, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create clear and comprehensive QA documentation, including test cases, test plans, test reports, and training material.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of software testing processes, SDLC/STLC, and Agile methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of SQL and database concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, analytical thinking, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience testing mobile games, web games, or live-service products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for gaming, with a genuine interest in playing and understanding casual games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong gaming mindset, including an understanding of player behaviour, engagement mechanics, progression, rewards, and LiveOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience testing Slots, Casino, or other real-money/social casino-style games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to test automation frameworks and AI-driven testing approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
