&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure our systems perform, and are reliable, scalable, and secure&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work in an agile environment where your opinions matter&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Team up with skilled colleagues that are committed to delivering the best products possible&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Share knowledge and help colleagues both inside and outside of your team&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Team player with good communication skills, someone who is easy to work with&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong computer science and engineering fundamentals (data structures, concurrency, design patterns, algorithms)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;High-quality and maintainable code writing&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Mastery of Java, C#, or another OO language, including experience with asynchronous, multi-threaded, parallel programming paradigms&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Always looking further to keep improving your skills&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Product Engineering Mindset&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You are not senior? Go for it and apply, we are seeking talented and driven engineers at all levels, from junior on up!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud computing (AWS, GCP...)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You do not fear acronyms like TDD, CI, CD&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with low-latency, high-volume distributed systems and Big Data computing technologies&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Web development on a modern framework such as React or Angular&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Scopely, we create games for everyone - and want to ensure that the people behind our games reflect that! &amp;nbsp; We are committed to creating a diverse, supportive work environment where everyone is treated with respect. We are committed to providing equal employment opportunities and welcome individuals from all backgrounds to join us &amp;amp; embrace the adventure!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Scopely&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely is a leading video game and global interactive entertainment company, home to many of the world’s most beloved and enduring experiences, including two of the most successful mobile games of all-time “MONOPOLY GO!” and “Pokémon GO,” along with “Stumble Guys,” “Star Trek™ Fleet Command,” “MARVEL Strike Force,” “WWE Champions,” the Scrabble® franchise, “Yahtzee® With Buddies,” and many others. Across mobile, web, PC, and console, Scopely creates, develops, publishes, and live-operates one of the most diversified and award-winning portfolios in the games industry — bringing hundreds of millions of players together through a shared love of play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2011, Scopely is powered by its exceptional team — including thousands of world-class gamemakers around the globe, a distinctive tenet-driven culture, and its proprietary technology platform, Playgami. Together, these strengths have fueled Scopely’s position as the #1 mobile games company in the U.S. and #2 globally, generating more than $10 billion in lifetime revenue. Whether building global sensations like “MONOPOLY GO!” from the ground up, or expanding through strategic acquisitions, including the FoxNext, GSN, and Scopely Explore games businesses — Scopely consistently delivers experiences players love today and return to for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized multiple times as one of the &quot;100 Most Influential Companies in the World&quot; by TIME magazine and one of Fast Company&#39;s &quot;World&#39;s Most Innovative Companies&quot; and “Best Workplaces for Innovators,” Scopely believes that video games can be a force for good — creating meaningful connections, vibrant communities, and making life better through play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely has global operations and partners across four continents in more than a dozen countries worldwide. For more information, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.scopely.com/&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Candidates: Scopely will never request payment or financial information during the application or hiring process. Please apply only through our official &lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt; and verify that all Talent Partner communications come from an email address ending in @&lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;scopely.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you have any questions or encounter any fraudulent requests/emails/websites, please immediately contact recruiting@scopely.com. Our job applicant privacy policies are available here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-ca-residents&quot;&gt;California Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/eea-and-uk-job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;EEA/UK Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment at Scopely is based solely on a person&#39;s merit and qualifications. Scopely does not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), or any other basis protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4033442008,"name":"Playgami","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":4036454008,"name":"All Barcelona Locations","location":null,"child_ids":[4036524008,4036519008,4036543008],"parent_id":4029776008}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/scopely/jobs/5180929008?gh_jid=5180929008","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":4456271008,"location":{"name":"JP - Tokyo, Japan"},"metadata":[{"id":4974618008,"name":"Worker Type","value":"Employee","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":6354091008,"name":"Time Type","value":"Full Time","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":6354150008,"name":"Referral Bonus Payout Type","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":6710077008,"name":"Work Arrangement","value":["Hybrid"],"value_type":"multi_select"},{"id":6752710008,"name":"Location","value":["Japan"],"value_type":"multi_select"},{"id":6755132008,"name":"Category","value":["Engineering"],"value_type":"multi_select"}],"id":5180929008,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T22:03:31-04:00","requisition_id":"JR106027","title":"Senior Software Engineer (Game Development) - Pikmin Bloom","company_name":"Scopely","first_published":"2026-04-16T04:33:45-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer (Game Development) - Pikmin Bloom &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; シニアソフトウェアエンジニア(ゲーム開発) - ピクミンブルーム&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely Explore (formerly known as Niantic), creator of hit games including Pokémon GO, Pikmin Bloom, and Monster Hunter Now is seeking a Client Engineer to help shape the future of our games by building high-quality, scalable gameplay systems that delight and engage our passionate players. We&#39;re a fast-paced, multi-disciplinary team of game makers, software developers, and creative professionals based all over the world. In this role, you will lead the technical design and implementation of cross-platform mobile experiences, driving performance, reliability, and engineering excellence — living up to our ambitious vision of merging the virtual with the real world and inspiring people to explore together!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical design and implementation of engaging, scalable gameplay systems for a large and active user base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own cross-platform development across mobile (iOS/Android), ensuring code is reusable, maintainable, and performant across multiple environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive performance optimization and reliability, including profiling, debugging, and troubleshooting complex issues on mobile devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with engineers, product managers, game designers, and UX designers to deliver high-quality user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership and mentorship to other engineers through code reviews, design reviews, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to engineering excellence, including improving development processes, testing practices, and overall code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Required in-office 3 days on Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS in Computer Science or a related technical field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in game development, with strong expertise in Unity and/or other game engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient working in C# or C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embraces generative AI with curiosity and good judgment, using it responsibly to improve tooling, testing, debugging, prototyping, and overall product quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced hybrid environment and handle stress appropriately and/or ability to solve practical problems and be sufficiently adaptable to handle dynamic situations with little advance notice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on cross-functional teams with ability to communicate effectively through written and verbal communications, including synchronous interactions with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Japanese language skills (intermediate - Business level)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plus If…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have mobile or console game performance optimization experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with shader programming (e.g., GLSL, HLSL, Metal).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for building products that connect people through shared real-world or interactive experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely Explore (旧Niantic)は、「Pokémon GO」「Pikmin Bloom」「Monster Hunter Now」などの人気タイトルを生み出してきたスタジオです。今回、私たちのゲームの未来を形づくるクライアントエンジニアを募集します。プレイヤーを魅了し続ける、高品質でスケーラブルなゲームプレイシステムの構築を担っていただきます。私たちは世界各地に拠点を持つ、ゲームメーカー・ソフトウェア開発者・クリエイティブ人材による、スピード感のあるマルチディシプリンチームです。本ポジションでは、クロスプラットフォームのモバイル体験の技術設計と実装をリードし、パフォーマンス・信頼性・エンジニアリングの卓越性を推進していただきます。「バーチャルとリアルを融合させ、人々が共に探索する喜びを広げる」という私たちの理念を実現するための、重要な役割です。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;職務内容(What you will do)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;大規模かつアクティブなユーザーベースに向けた、魅力的でスケーラブルなゲームプレイシステムの技術設計と実装をリードする&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;モバイル(iOS/Android)におけるクロスプラットフォーム開発を担い、複数の環境で再利用性・保守性・パフォーマンスに優れたコードを実現する&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;プロファイリング、デバッグ、複雑な問題のトラブルシューティングを含む、パフォーマンス最適化と信頼性向上を推進する&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;エンジニア、プロダクトマネージャー、ゲームデザイナー、UXデザイナーと部門を横断して連携し、高品質なユーザー体験を実現する&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;コードレビュー、設計レビュー、知識共有を通じて、他のエンジニアに対する技術的リーダーシップとメンタリングを提供する&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;開発プロセス、テスト手法、コード品質全体の改善など、エンジニアリングの卓越性向上に貢献する&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;勤務形態：火・水・木の週3日を出社勤務とするハイブリッド勤務 (詳細な勤務条件は雇用契約書・就業規則に基づきます)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;応募資格(What you will need)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;コンピューターサイエンスまたは関連する技術分野の学士号相当の知識・経験 (実務経験による同等の知識・スキルも可)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ゲーム開発における5年以上の実務経験があり、Unityおよび/またはその他のゲームエンジンに関する高い専門性を有すること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C#またはC++を用いた開発経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;生成AIに対して探究心と適切な判断力を持ち、ツール開発・テスト・デバッグ・プロトタイピングおよびプロダクト品質向上のために責任を持って活用できること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;変化の速い環境下でも適切に業務を遂行できる適応力、または予告の少ない状況変化にも柔軟に対応し、実践的な問題解決を行える能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;部門を横断したチームでの協働経験があり、口頭・文書双方で効果的にコミュニケーションを取れること(同時双方向のやり取りを含む)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;日本語能力(中級以上)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;プラスアルファ条件(Plus if…)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;モバイルまたはコンソールゲームのパフォーマンス最適化に関する経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;シェーダープログラミングの経験 (GLSL、HLSL、Metalなど)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;現実世界での体験やインタラクティブな体験を通じて人々をつなげるプロダクト開発への熱意&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Scopely&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely is a leading video game and global interactive entertainment company, home to many of the world’s most beloved and enduring experiences, including two of the most successful mobile games of all-time “MONOPOLY GO!” and “Pokémon GO,” along with “Stumble Guys,” “Star Trek™ Fleet Command,” “MARVEL Strike Force,” “WWE Champions,” the Scrabble® franchise, “Yahtzee® With Buddies,” and many others. Across mobile, web, PC, and console, Scopely creates, develops, publishes, and live-operates one of the most diversified and award-winning portfolios in the games industry — bringing hundreds of millions of players together through a shared love of play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2011, Scopely is powered by its exceptional team — including thousands of world-class gamemakers around the globe, a distinctive tenet-driven culture, and its proprietary technology platform, Playgami. Together, these strengths have fueled Scopely’s position as the #1 mobile games company in the U.S. and #2 globally, generating more than $10 billion in lifetime revenue. Whether building global sensations like “MONOPOLY GO!” from the ground up, or expanding through strategic acquisitions, including the FoxNext, GSN, and Scopely Explore games businesses — Scopely consistently delivers experiences players love today and return to for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized multiple times as one of the &quot;100 Most Influential Companies in the World&quot; by TIME magazine and one of Fast Company&#39;s &quot;World&#39;s Most Innovative Companies&quot; and “Best Workplaces for Innovators,” Scopely believes that video games can be a force for good — creating meaningful connections, vibrant communities, and making life better through play.&lt;/p&gt;
