e":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior UI Artist&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our MONOPOLY GO! team in Barcelona (Spain) on a hybrid basis!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MONOPOLY GO! is a global phenomenon and the biggest mobile game launch in history, captivating millions of players worldwide. The team is based in Europe and the US and works daily to create captivating new experiences for our players.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Senior UI Artist&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every season of Monopoly GO! introduces new ways for players to play, explore, and interact. Great UI is what makes those experiences feel intuitive, polished, and rewarding, guiding players through the game while reinforcing the personality and charm that defines every season.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The craft of UI design is evolving just as quickly as the game itself, and we expect our Senior UI Artists to evolve with it. That&#39;s because we believe modern creative careers reward those who continuously evolve. AI fluency and the ability to quickly adopt new tools are part of the craft, not optional extras.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re motivated by crafting beautiful, intuitive experiences, refining your design practice through new tools and technologies, and seeing your work shape how millions of players experience Monopoly GO!, you&#39;ll find no shortage of opportunities here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create mockups, pitches, and polished UI assets for Monopoly GO! features, translating flowcharts and wireframes into usable, delightful UI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI-assisted tools and workflows fluently within your UI practice, identifying, refining, and sharing approaches that meaningfully improve quality, iteration, or efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with game designers, UX designers, concept artists, animators, and engineers to keep the player experience consistent and high-quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and advocate for your UI direction to stakeholders, and mentor junior UI artists informally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the point of contact for UI questions on your assigned features, keeping production updated on progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years practical art/design experience in games, preferably mobile, with 2+ years in a senior-level capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated fluency with AI-assisted creative tools and the judgment to identify where they can meaningfully improve your own UI design and production workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record shipping polished UI systems for mobile titles, collaborating across Design, UX, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level UI/UX and graphic design skills, including typography and interaction design, backed by mastery of Photoshop, Illustrator, and Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive attitude and the ability to give and receive objective feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating the brand guidelines and approval pipeline of at least one externally-licensed IP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for mobile gaming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please ensure that the résumé/CV you attach is written in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;671&quot;&gt;At Scopely, we create games for everyone - and want to ensure that the people behind our games reflect that! We are committed to creating a diverse, supportive work environment where everyone is treated with respect. We are committed to providing equal employment opportunities and welcome individuals from all backgrounds to join us &amp;amp; embrace the adventure!&lt;/p&gt;
