ly is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Sr&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Motion Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Marketing Creative Services team, Flamed, in our &lt;strong&gt;Barcelona office&lt;/strong&gt; on a hybrid basis (3 days at the office).&lt;/p&gt;
