lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scopely is seeking a Talent Partner to attract, engage, and hire exceptional talent across Engineering, Data, AI/ML, Marketing and Technical Product functions.&lt;/strong&gt; We are looking for a strategic talent partner who understands the evolving technology landscape, builds trusted relationships with leaders, and is passionate about helping scale high-performing teams through world-class hiring practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage the full lifecycle recruiting process for technical roles across the organization, from intake through offer acceptance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering, Product, Data, AI/ML, and Technology leaders to understand current and future talent needs and develop effective hiring strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and engage top technical talent through proactive market mapping, networking, referrals, and direct sourcing techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain high-quality passive candidate pipelines for critical and hard-to-fill technical roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a strategic advisor to hiring managers by providing talent market insights, competitive intelligence, and recommendations on hiring strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute creative sourcing approaches to identify and attract top engineering and technical talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate candidate backgrounds, technical experience, and career trajectories against role requirements and team needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure an exceptional candidate experience through consistent communication, transparency, and effective process management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with interview teams to drive calibration, alignment on hiring criteria, and high-quality assessment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage offer development, negotiation, and closing activities while partnering with Compensation, HR, and business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and recruiting metrics to identify opportunities, improve hiring outcomes, and optimize recruiting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on industry trends, emerging technologies, AI-enabled recruiting practices, and evolving technical talent markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of full-cycle technical recruiting experience, preferably within gaming, technology, software, AI/ML, or high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success recruiting for Engineering, Data Science, IT/Security, Technical Product, or related technical functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong passive candidate sourcing capabilities and experience building talent pipelines for highly competitive technical markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to assess technical talent and understand software development processes, engineering disciplines, and technical career paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with senior leaders and hiring managers to develop hiring strategies and influence talent decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and relationship-building skills with the ability to establish credibility across all levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interviewing, candidate assessment, and closing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple searches simultaneously in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset with the ability to leverage recruiting metrics and market insights to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within an in-house Talent Acquisition team preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience.
&lt;p&gt;PREFERRED EXPERIENCE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with modern AI development methodologies and AI-enabled workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience using advanced sourcing tools, talent intelligence platforms, and AI-assisted recruiting technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please ensure that the résumé/CV you attach is written in English.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Scopely&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely is a leading video game and global interactive entertainment company, home to many of the world’s most beloved and enduring experiences, including two of the most successful mobile games of all-time “MONOPOLY GO!” and “Pokémon GO,” along with “Stumble Guys,” “Star Trek™ Fleet Command,” “MARVEL Strike Force,” “WWE Champions,” the Scrabble® franchise, “Yahtzee® With Buddies,” and many others. Across mobile, web, PC, and console, Scopely creates, develops, publishes, and live-operates one of the most diversified and award-winning portfolios in the games industry — bringing hundreds of millions of players together through a shared love of play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2011, Scopely is powered by its exceptional team — including thousands of world-class gamemakers around the globe, a distinctive tenet-driven culture, and its proprietary technology platform, Playgami. Together, these strengths have fueled Scopely’s position as the #1 mobile games company in the U.S. and #2 globally, generating more than $10 billion in lifetime revenue. Whether building global sensations like “MONOPOLY GO!” from the ground up, or expanding through strategic acquisitions, including the FoxNext, GSN, and Scopely Explore games businesses — Scopely consistently delivers experiences players love today and return to for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized multiple times as one of the &quot;100 Most Influential Companies in the World&quot; by TIME magazine and one of Fast Company&#39;s &quot;World&#39;s Most Innovative Companies&quot; and “Best Workplaces for Innovators,” Scopely believes that video games can be a force for good — creating meaningful connections, vibrant communities, and making life better through play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely has global operations and partners across four continents in more than a dozen countries worldwide. For more information, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.scopely.com/&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
