tion_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Technical Product Manager - AI t&lt;/strong&gt;o join our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Gen AI team&lt;/strong&gt; in Bangalore!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely is seeking a strategic and execution-focused Technical Product Manager (AI Solutions) to lead the development, adoption, and scaling of AI-powered products and solutions that serve a wide range of internal stakeholders across multiple business units.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is focused on identifying, building, and scaling AI-driven tools and platforms that improve efficiency, unlock new capabilities, and drive measurable business impact across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director of AI, this role requires strong collaboration with engineering, design, production, and business stakeholders across Scopely&#39;s global studios, as well as close alignment with Scopely&#39;s broader data and platform teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.Product Strategy &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Product Lifecycle: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the end-to-end product lifecycle for AI solutions, from ideation to launch, adoption, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define Vision &amp;amp; Roadmap: &lt;/strong&gt;Define product vision, strategy, and roadmap aligned with company objectives and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify High-Impact Opportunities: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with stakeholders to identify high-impact opportunities for AI across business units and translate them into product initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-Own Prioritization: &lt;/strong&gt;Co-own roadmap and prioritization decisions in collaboration with the Director of AI and Scopely&#39;s CTO, balancing short-term delivery with long-term platform thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2.Adoption &amp;amp; Impact Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Adoption: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead adoption of AI solutions across internal stakeholders and business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define Success Metrics: &lt;/strong&gt;Align closely with stakeholders to define success metrics, expected outcomes, and measurable impact per initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track and Report: &lt;/strong&gt;Track and report on product performance, usage, and business outcomes, ensuring solutions deliver tangible efficiency gains, capability uplift, or revenue impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3.Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge Technical &amp;amp; Business Teams: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with engineering, design, and business stakeholders to define requirements and deliver solutions, acting as the bridge between technical teams and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate Needs into Architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with the GenAI Agentic Engineering Team to translate business and stakeholder needs into technical architecture and product plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align Across Scopely: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with other Scopely teams across regions and studios to align on best practices and leverage existing platforms and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4.Delivery &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with Project Management and Lead Engineers to ensure proper backlog prioritization, product specifications, and release planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Agile Process: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive agile development processes and ensure timely, high-quality delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Iterate on Feedback: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor adoption, performance, and user feedback to continuously improve products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5.AI Solutions Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Across the Business: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead development of AI-enabled tools that support internal workflows across multiple business units, including production, operations, marketing, HR, business development, customer support, and finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Scalability: &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure solutions are scalable, usable, and aligned with real business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Responsible AI: &lt;/strong&gt;Support responsible AI practices, including governance, transparency, security, and appropriate use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6.Stakeholder &amp;amp; Change Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Engage stakeholders across multiple functions to drive alignment and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate Clearly: &lt;/strong&gt;Communicate product vision, updates, and outcomes clearly to leadership and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenge &amp;amp; Recommend: &lt;/strong&gt;Challenge assumptions and provide structured, well-reasoned recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;5+ years of experience in product management or related roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven experience owning the product lifecycle from concept to delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience working with cross-functional teams in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong understanding of AI, data-driven products, and platform-based solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong problem-solving and structured thinking ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience in gaming, tech, and/or digital product environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exposure to AI/ML concepts and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience working across multiple business functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Scopely, we create games for everyone - and want to ensure that the people behind our games reflect that! We are committed to creating a diverse, supportive work environment where everyone is treated with respect. We are committed to providing equal employment opportunities and welcome individuals from all backgrounds to join us &amp;amp; embrace the adventure!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
