ine":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;UX Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Scopely Explore Player Platform&amp;nbsp;team in &lt;strong&gt;Mexico City&lt;/strong&gt; on a hybrid basis, working 3 days a week from the hub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll partner closely with engineers, product managers, and other creative professionals in an agile, team-oriented environment. You infuse fresh ideas with established design patterns, present your work clearly and confidently, and value feedback as part of an iterative process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who champions the needs of our players, blending intuition with data-driven insights to create seamless and engaging experiences. You’ll design intuitive end-to-end flows, craft thoughtful visual design, and build prototypes that bring ideas to life. As a skilled storyteller, you’ll translate complex use cases into simple, scalable solutions, while maintaining a high attention to detail in your work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead UX design efforts from concept to implementation for one or more player-facing experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop wireframes, appealing mockups, prototypes, and detailed design documentation to clearly describe interaction flows and design concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly communicate ideas and UX designs to team members, external partners, and leadership through prototypes and presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in team rituals to conceptualize and brainstorm new features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve and extend existing design system patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incorporate user research and player insights into all stages of design exploration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional team members and partners, including regular and reliable attendance and participation in meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years or equivalent experience in UX design, with a portfolio showcasing projects across mobile applications and responsive web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Figma and creating high-fidelity prototypes with a prototyping tool of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with mobile UX design patterns applied in gaming, fitness, or activity-related experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing implementation-ready UX mockups and flows that clearly support development handoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual design skills, with a solid understanding of typography, layout, hierarchy, and core graphic design principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with using AI tools to support UX exploration, concept development, and prototyping, while critically evaluating and shaping the output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem-solving skills and the ability to develop novel UX patterns as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced hybrid environment and adapt to changing priorities, solve practical problems, and communicate proactively when plans shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on cross-functional teams with the ability to communicate effectively through written and verbal communications, including asynchronous interactions with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong English language skills are required for this role as we have a highly diverse and global business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and experience with HTML/CSS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with motion design or animation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please ensure that the résumé/CV you attach is written in English and includes a portfolio link or PDF to examples of your work in the application.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
